"given.\n"
"If you choose 'Advanced-Setup', you have the possibility, to do some "
"changes, to\n"
"      the configuration, and to setup some other options.\n"
"If you choose 'Save & Exit', you can save the project to disk and to do "
"some\n"
"      advanced configuration later"
msgstr ""
"Noraboa, o asistente está neste momento terminado !\n"
"Se escolle 'Iniciar Agora',  KWebGet iniciará-se coa informazón que lle deu.\n"
